<title>USA: Shaw group cuts MFS Communications stake.</title>
<headline>Shaw group cuts MFS Communications stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by D. E. Shaw and Co Inc said it cut its stake in MFS Communications Co Inc to 230,800 depositary shares or 2.5 percent of the class outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 211,300 shares on August 26 and 27 at prices ranging from $70.8125 to $73.9193 per share.</p>
